# Cloudflare Pages reads this file automatically from the repo root and
# applies these headers to every response. Drop this in alongside
# index.html — no config needed on the Cloudflare dashboard side.
#
# CSP built from an actual audit of this file (2026-07-18), not a
# generic template:
#   - script-src needs 'unsafe-inline' because this is a single HTML
#     file with an inline <script> block and no build step to add
#     nonces/hashes. No eval(), no new Function(), no document.write()
#     anywhere in the runtime code — confirmed by grep.
#     static.cloudflareinsights.com is added because Cloudflare Pages
#     auto-injects the Web Analytics beacon (`beacon.min.js`) on the
#     Pro plan; without it in script-src the beacon triggers a CSP
#     console error (found in Lighthouse audit 2026-08-05).
#   - style-src needs 'unsafe-inline' for the same reason (inline
#     <style> block + inline style="" attributes throughout), plus
#     fonts.googleapis.com for the Google Fonts stylesheet.
#   - font-src needs fonts.gstatic.com — that's where the actual font
#     files the googleapis.com stylesheet points to are served from.
#   - img-src needs data: — every image on the site (base64 embedded)
#     and the favicon are data URIs, not external files.
#   - connect-src is 'self' only — confirmed zero fetch()/XHR calls
#     anywhere in the file. The transparency widget measures the
#     page's own Performance API entries, it doesn't call out anywhere.
#   - form-action 'none' — the contact <form> has no action attribute;
#     JS intercepts submit and hands off to a mailto: link, it never
#     does a real HTTP form submission.
#   - frame-ancestors 'self' — prevents this site being framed
#     elsewhere (clickjacking protection); harmless for the legitimate
#     sandboxed-iframe-preview use case since that's framing the file
#     FROM this origin's own tooling context, not the reverse.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; object-src 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
